 'conversation datasets are significantly smaller than the multi-terabyte '
 'datasets used for initial pre-training.',
 "Hardcoding specific 'who are you' questions into the SFT dataset forces the "
 'model to adopt a specific identity, preventing it from defaulting to '
 'statistical hallucinations of being another entity (like ChatGPT) found in '
 'its pre-training data.']

WHY IT MATTERS:
