['Reliability: Understanding the limits of model memory versus tool use allows '
 "for building systems that admit when they don't know an answer, drastically "
 'reducing hallucination.',
 'Scaling reasoning: Moving beyond simple imitation to RL-based reasoning '
 'allows models to solve complex, novel problems and perform accurate '
 'multi-step calculations.']
