 "an LLM's parameters can be viewed as a 'zip file' of the training internet "
 'data.']

WHY IT MATTERS:
['Understanding that models are just parameter files and inference code '
 "clarifies why 'open weights' models (like Llama 2) provide transparency and "
 'local control, unlike proprietary interfaces like ChatGPT.']
